                <pb facs="0214" n="108" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg108"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sorsby to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-05-08"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 8,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Government of Bolivia extends through the legation cordial invitation Secretary
                    of State to visit Bolivia during his southern trip. Bolivian minister at
                    Washington also has been instructed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sorsby.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
